# Until end of turn the target's power is doubled and it has first strike (CR 701.10, 702.7): Bot1's attacking Llanowar Elves (1/1) is
# blocked by Bot2's Llanowar Elves (1/1), and Legion Leadership cast after blockers makes it a 2/1 first striker. It kills the
# blocker in the first-strike step and takes no damage; without the spell both Elves would die. Paid by Mox Ruby ({R/W}) and Mox
# Pearl.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Legion Leadership
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Block(Llanowar Elves > Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Legion Leadership.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Damage = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 2
